    """Find every start time, by day, when the user and all the listed attendees are free for a meeting of the given length. days are mon to fri; earliest is the first allowed start and latest_end the time the meeting must end by, both HH:MM or empty. Returns the workable starts, earliest first."""
    def parse_time(text):
